    <string name="config_permissions_header">PERMISSIONS AND PRIVILEGE</string>
    <string name="config_permissions_intro">Root or wireless ADB already give Kairos elevated privilege for itself — you don\'t need Shizuku installed for that. Shizuku only matters for granting permission to OTHER apps, and not even Shizuku itself can do that unless that app already bundled its SDK (see "Credits" below).</string>
